e><polyline points=\"17 11 19 13 23 9\"></polyline></svg><span class=\"on_follow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Follow Jacintoyq  Student</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Follow</span></span><span class=\"on_unfollow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Following Jacintoyq  Student</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Following</span></span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fjacintoyq.itch.io%2Fpony-island&amp;intent=add_to_collection\" class=\"action_btn add_to_collection_btn\"><svg stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" class=\"svgicon icon_collection_add2\"><path d=\"M 1,6 H 14\" /><path d=\"M 1,11 H 14\" /><path d=\"m 1,16 h 9\" /><path d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/5073741/pony-island\" target=\"_blank\" data-label=\"related_btn\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_medium family_pixel\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"Pony Island\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMzcyMjA4LmpwZw==/original/G0QjMv.jpg\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Pony Island</h1></div><div class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\" id=\"view_game_333073\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a href=\"https://jacintoyq.itch.io/pony-island/purchase\" class=\"button buy_btn\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><h4 class=\"text-center\">Pony Island</h4>\r\n<p><strong>It looks like a game about ponies. It is not a game about ponies.</strong>\r\n </p>\r\n<p>Somewhere between life and whatever comes after, there is an old arcade cabinet. Its screen flickers with pastel skies, cheerful music, and a smiling pony ready to gallop and jump. It seems harmless, even cute.\r\n </p>\r\n<p>Then the glitches start.\r\n </p>\r\n<p>The machine is broken, and it was built by someone who very much wants you to stay. Its creator is the Devil himself. He hates when players find the cracks in his work, and he will mock you every time you do. Your soul is on the line, and the only way out is to break the game from the inside.\r\n </p>\r\n<h4>What awaits you</h4>\r\n<ul> <li><strong>A game within a game.</strong> Play the Devil&#x27;s twisted pony runner, then tear it apart when it stops making sense.\r\n </li><li><strong>Hack your way out.</strong> Dive into the machine&#x27;s corrupted code and solve logic puzzles built around rewriting how the game works.\r\n </li><li><strong>Meet the others trapped inside.</strong> Messages from lost souls hide in the system, some helpful, some desperate.\r\n </li><li><strong>An antagonist who talks back.</strong> Lucifer watches, comments, cheats, and gets personally offended by your progress.\r\n </li><li><strong>Unsettling and funny at the same time.</strong> A short, sharp experience that plays with your expectations, and with the fourth wall.\r\n </li></ul>\r\n<h4>Details:</h4>\r\n<ul><li><strong>Genre:</strong> Psychological horror / puzzle&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Length:</strong> About 2–4 hours</li><li><strong>Style:</strong> Pixel art, CRT glitches, and an eerie original soundtrack</li></ul>\r\n<pre class=\"text-center\">Insert your ticket. Ride the pony. Don&#x27;t trust the machine.\r\n</pre></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" height=\"6\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" width=\"12\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\" id=\"game_info_panel_4582715\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Published</td><td><abbr title=\"29 September 2026 @ 12:14 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 6 hours ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div tabindex=\"0\" data-tooltip=\"4.83 average rating from 6 total ratings\" class=\"aggregate_rating\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/AggregateRating\" itemprop=\"aggregateRating\"><div content=\"4.8\" itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"star_value\"><span class=\"screenreader_only\">Rated 4.8 out of 5 stars</span><div style=\"width: 96.66667%\" class=\"star_fill\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"t